        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 6000, Stainless Steel Privacy Bolt with T Turn</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPrivacy deadbolts are commonly used on doors that require locking from the inside with emergency unlocking turn from the outside. The Omnia Privacy Bolt is made of solid stainless steel with a brushed stainless finish. The Stainless Steel Privacy Bolt with T Turn comes with all the hardware for both sides of the door. Its modern look is great for new builds. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Bolt (Bathroom and Bedroom):</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 6000 Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter (both interior and exterior): 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection (both interior and exterior): 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Turnpiece: 1-3/4\" x 1-1/4\" Projection</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>",
